From a0550b0726c3527d6c7a43c5dcb6115c24d4bc4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 15:17:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] gui: on-device review round 3 - 10 UI fixes (live-data +
 recolor + regressions)

From on-device review of the flashed shell-fix build:
- reaper_shell.asp: shell topbar pills now populate off-dashboard - define
  --jade (WAN light), robust uptime parser + fallback, and poll appGet.cgi
  get_clientlist/get_cfg_clientlist for client/mesh counts (the old
  httpApi.hookGet ran before httpApi.js loaded). Reboot-button clip fix
  (btn right padding + grid minmax(0,1fr)); header bar +8px (.top padding +
  .stage 56->64).
- reaper_content.css: USB storage icon pinned to dark sprite state (was salmon
  fill); client-list rows flat dark card (was teal bg.png + border); AiMesh
  .user_icon tile black (was teal #596E74); GameBoost slider knob darkened so
  bone labels read.
- GameBoost.asp: EULA "Disagree" reverts via un-checking the toggle instead of
  reloading the framed iframe (the reload stranded the shell-owned modal).
- Advanced_OperationMode_Content.asp: operation-mode image sized via
  center/contain + 260px height (was native 1536x1024 = zoomed).
- Main_ReaperDash.asp: ddns_host / usb path nvram encoded via nvram_char_to_ascii.
- sysdep/FUNCTION/RWD_UI/rwd_component.css: SDN/MLO shared component library
  recolored teal/blue -> reaper (116 tokens across hex/rgb/rgba); toggle ->
  neutral grey, accents -> crimson, blue-greys -> bone/dark surfaces.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
