 /* GameBoost "Game Priority" wide ON/OFF slider (#game_priority_enable): its
    own .switch/.container/.container::after collided with the global toggle
-   recolor, leaving grey-on-grey text hidden under the knob. Give it contrast:
-   dark track, bone knob, readable white ON/OFF labels. */
+   recolor, leaving grey-on-grey text hidden under the knob. The prior fix made
+   BOTH the knob and the lifted labels bone, so the label under the knob was
